WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:19.872
"Do you mean I can go home?" shouted Toad.

2
00:00:19.873 --> 00:00:23.671
"Oh, I will sleep at Toad Hall again!"

3
00:00:23.672 --> 00:00:26.673
Toad jumped up and down.

4
00:00:26.674 --> 00:00:30.134
"Shh," the jailer's daughter said.

5
00:00:30.135 --> 00:00:32.470
She looked around.

6
00:00:32.471 --> 00:00:35.676
"I have an aunt who is a washwoman.

7
00:00:35.677 --> 00:00:39.288
My aunt does the prison wash," she said.

8
00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:42.158
"What a hard job!" said Toad.

9
00:00:42.159 --> 00:00:44.942
"And for the whole prison too!

10
00:00:44.943 --> 00:00:47.339
Think of all the dirty clothes!"

11
00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:51.552
"Quiet, Toad," the daughter said. "Listen!"

12
00:00:51.553 --> 00:00:55.320
She continued, "Since you are rich . . ."

13
00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:59.139
"Well, I am rich," said Toad.

14
00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:02.688
"If you give her some money," she said,

15
00:01:02.689 --> 00:01:07.090
"my aunt will give you her dress and bonnet."

16
00:01:07.091 --> 00:01:11.669
"Why would I want her old dress?" said Toad.

17
00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.282
"To escape!" she said.

18
00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:16.745
"You can pretend to be her!"

19
00:01:16.746 --> 00:01:19.680
Toad was surprised.

20
00:01:19.681 --> 00:01:23.480
"Me? Dress like a washwoman?

21
00:01:23.481 --> 00:01:27.747
I am Toad of Toad Hall!" said Toad.

22
00:01:27.748 --> 00:01:30.867
He proudly shook his head.

23
00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:35.070
The jailer's daughter got angry.

24
00:01:35.071 --> 00:01:39.631
"Maybe you can escape in a coach!" she shouted.

25
00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:42.272
"A coach with four horses!"

26
00:01:42.273 --> 00:01:44.878
She opened the door to leave.

27
00:01:44.879 --> 00:01:48.447
"I'm sorry," Toad said.

28
00:01:48.448 --> 00:01:50.660
"You are so nice.

29
00:01:50.661 --> 00:01:53.338
And I am a stupid toad."

30
00:01:53.339 --> 00:01:55.872
The jailer's daughter stopped.

31
00:01:55.873 --> 00:02:01.056
"Introduce me to your aunt," said Toad.
